reason: OPEN PORT GAP, not an accepted difference: the oracle refuses http://[::1/x as an invalid IPv6 literal, the port's URL parser accepts it. Pinned so the suite fails the day the port closes the gap or someone quietly rewrites the golden; recorded for follow-up in plans/seekwright-ocaml-port.md.
